  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "初始引导\n哦，是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "离我们上一次见面，已经过去了很久。\n这段时间里......你一直徘徊在悬崖的边缘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你可能已经忘记了你的身份，但你还记得那个名字，这就够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——好了，别在这里逗留太久。\n毕竟，你既不是我的客人，也不应该出现在这里。\n她需要你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "12月23日。\n你可能记不清这一天对你来说，究竟意味着什么。\n这会让你陷入十分危险的处境。\n......\n不。\n你必须想起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "......知觉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "开始循环............阻升主......停跳液注入完成......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "......体温过低............海克塞米松20cc，静推。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "止血钳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "......状态正常......开始切除......注意室颤......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "......抱歉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "又让你受苦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "博士......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": ".......手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "抓......紧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "抓紧我的手！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "紧急......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......救......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......束了......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "博士，博士！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "医生，博士他还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "刚才，刚才博士......明明已经拉住我的手了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "但是到现在，博士都没有清醒......怎么办......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "阿米娅！别那么着急，稍微冷静点！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "啊......抱，抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "一遇到和博士有关的事情，你就变得慌慌张张的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "只不过，阿米娅，如果博士还是.....你该怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "——我做好心理准备了。就像我们之前说的那样做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "......我知道了。就按你说的做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "那就......拜托你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "那博士......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "放心吧阿米娅，博士的状况已经稳定了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "我再检查一次好了，包在我身上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "那就......拜托你了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "嗯。呼吸比较微弱，血压正常。应该不要紧的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "你醒了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "阿米娅，成功了，博士清醒了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "博士......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "太好了，太好了......博士......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "啊，小心！你现在还不能......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "先别动，你的身体还没有完全适应。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "博士......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你们......是谁？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "啊——博士——我......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "我叫阿米娅。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "我们是来救你的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......我是......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "你......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "你和我们一样，也是“罗德岛”组织的一员。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......是我的同伴。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "——Dr.{@nickname}。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "你是我，最重要的同伴。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "博士......不记得了吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......我真的能相信你吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "text": "......",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "text": "我知道。我知道这对于博士你来说很难接受。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "text": "我没有奢望你现在就能回忆起过去，也不会要求你现在就信任我。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "text": "难道说，Dr.{@nickname}也不记得我了......",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "text": "......",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "text": "就算是这样......我也不会放弃的。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "text": "我们为了找到你，已经付出了很多很多......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "是吗......初次见面，阿米娅。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "text": "啊，你，你好。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "text": "......",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "text": "不，我不是......我不知道该怎么说......很多事情都不再是以前那样了。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "text": "就连我，肯定也变得和过去不一样......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "至少，对我来说，博士始终是我最重要的人。无论发生什么事，这一点是不会改变的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "所以，请你.....请你多给我一点时间。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "哪怕只是一小段时间......",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "博士真的......失忆了吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "没关系，如果，这样能给博士一点空间的话......",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这里到底是......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "这里——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "诶？发生了什————",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "全副武装的男性",
          "text": "阿米娅，有情况！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "全副武装的男性",
          "text": "有人闯进了设施！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "全副武装的男性",
          "text": "他们的打扮......不是乌萨斯士兵！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
          "text": "——————",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "全副武装的男性",
          "text": "你们想干什么！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "全副武装的男性",
          "text": "敌袭！阿米娅，敌人装备了重火力兵器！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "唔唔唔唔！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "大家注意！利用掩体，保护好博士！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "这打扮难道是......整合运动？怎么会......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "近卫人员......做好战斗准备！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近卫干员",
          "text": "明白！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近卫干员",
          "text": "可恶，这些家伙是冲着博士来的吗！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "不......博士的存在不会有别人知道才对。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "凯尔希医生的远程通讯呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近卫干员",
          "text": "不知道为什么，设备停止工作了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......有什么切断了我们之间的通讯。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "乌萨斯政府发现了我们的行踪吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近卫干员",
          "text": "现在要怎么办？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "原本负责这次行动的凯尔希医生，现在没办法参与指挥......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "————Dr.{@nickname}。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "————我希望，由博士来指挥。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "text": "这......会不会太冒险了，博士才刚刚......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......我想......试一试。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "虽然失去了记忆，但博士确实曾与我们......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......一同战斗过。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "谢谢你教会了我这么多......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "我们一起经历了许多许多......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "我知道的......博士你能为我们带来胜利。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "你能为我们带来胜利。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......我明白这样突然请求你很失礼。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "但是，但是......拜托了，请你助我们一臂之力。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "我也会辅助你的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
